# sees other buffers; the passphrase TLV after the NUL of the name is never read). One row per EVENT: P7 (scan, connect) and P13 (rxctrl, rxctrl_ret) are 2 rows each, P14 has no return probe (void function), P21 has 2 rows (escanparams, escanparamsv1), so N = 29 (run plan c1dc240b).
