# Probes on the escan params (symbol wl_do_escan, any label or offset, and wldev_iovar_setbuf which receives the same buffer; r1 F6): the params buffer in %x2 is [8 B header][wl_scan_params]. v1 puts SSID/BSSID/bss_type at buffer bytes 8..50,
